WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.534
-Good evening I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.534 --> 00:00:04.000
We hope you're doing all right.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.234
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.234 --> 00:00:08.534
President Biden appeared
last night on "60 Minutes"

00:00:08.534 --> 00:00:11.501
and spoke about the ongoing war
between Israel and Hamas.

00:00:11.501 --> 00:00:13.267
And you could tell
he was nervous

00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:18.100
because he kept asking,
"How many more minutes?"

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.434
The Senate returned this week
from a fall recess.

00:00:20.434 --> 00:00:25.534
Unfortunately, the House
is still in detention.

00:00:25.534 --> 00:00:26.801
House Republicans on Friday

00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:28.634
picked Ohio Congressman
Jim Jordan

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:30.534
to be their nominee
for speaker of the House.

00:00:30.534 --> 00:00:36.267
The vote was 81 "no"
and 124, "Yeah, fine."

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:38.133
Republican Congressman
Jorge Santos

00:00:38.133 --> 00:00:40.534
reportedly got into
a screaming match on Thursday

00:00:40.534 --> 00:00:42.400
with an activist
at the Capitol

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:45.601
while holding
a two month old baby.

00:00:45.601 --> 00:00:47.901
So finally,
he's actually representing

00:00:47.901 --> 00:00:49.834
the people
of Long Island.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.534
Currently-indicted Republican
Congressman Jorge Santos

00:00:55.534 --> 00:00:57.834
was seen leaving
a colleague's office

00:00:57.834 --> 00:01:00.300
carrying a mysterious baby,

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:02.567
and when he was asked
if the baby was his,

00:01:02.567 --> 00:01:06.534
he replied, "Not yet."

00:01:06.534 --> 00:01:10.667
Which brings us to a segment
called, "Okay, but for real,

00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:13.367
someone's got eyes
on this baby, right?"

00:01:13.367 --> 00:01:17.834
♪♪

00:01:17.834 --> 00:01:21.334
Look, I know there's a lot going
on in the House right now,

00:01:21.334 --> 00:01:22.667
what with the no speaker

00:01:22.667 --> 00:01:25.167
and the nomination of election
denying insurrectionists.

00:01:25.167 --> 00:01:28.534
But for real, someone's got eyes
on this baby, right?

00:01:28.534 --> 00:01:30.234
Because I don't know
what's happening in this photo,

00:01:30.234 --> 00:01:32.667
I just know it's not good.

00:01:32.667 --> 00:01:35.200
Jorge Santos is currently
under indictment for 23 crimes,

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:37.067
and by the look of this picture,
he's going for 24.

00:01:37.067 --> 00:01:41.767
I mean, the man's running like
he just intercepted a football.

00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:43.300
And then when asked
if the baby was his,

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:47.901
Santos opted for the most
dramatic possible answer.

00:01:47.901 --> 00:01:50.534
"Not yet."

00:01:50.534 --> 00:01:54.634
Is he a congressman or
a "Days of Our Lives" villain?

00:01:54.634 --> 00:01:56.767
What does "not yet" mean?
Is he going to adopt it,

00:01:56.767 --> 00:01:59.834
or is he going to do away
with the parents?

00:01:59.834 --> 00:02:01.300
Someone please send me a picture

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:02.701
of this baby
holding today's paper,

00:02:02.701 --> 00:02:05.734
because right now
I'm very concerned.

00:02:05.734 --> 00:02:07.501
But at least now we know
Jorge Santos

00:02:07.501 --> 00:02:09.667
isn't the craziest person
on Capitol Hill.

00:02:09.667 --> 00:02:14.334
That title goes to whoever
voluntarily handed a baby

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:16.968
to Jorge Santos.

00:02:16.968 --> 00:02:18.067
-This has been...

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:23.467 --> 00:02:27.601
-The CEO of the movie theater
chain AMC posted last week

00:02:27.601 --> 00:02:29.300
that a blackmailer
had catfished him

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:31.033
and attempted
to extort him for money.

00:02:31.033 --> 00:02:32.334
"I know the feeling,"

00:02:32.334 --> 00:02:36.167
said someone who just paid $40
for popcorn and a drink.

00:02:40.667 --> 00:02:42.434
A woman in Australia
is recovering

00:02:42.434 --> 00:02:45.534
after she tried to rescue
a platypus with her bare hands,

00:02:45.534 --> 00:02:48.601
and was stabbed
with its poisonous spurs.

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:49.934
Though in her defense,

00:02:49.934 --> 00:02:54.400
even the platypus
didn't know it could do that.

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:59.901
"Damn, I truly am weird as hell.

00:02:59.901 --> 00:03:05.467
Every day, I learn
a new crazy fact about me.

00:03:05.467 --> 00:03:07.901
Oh, I just laid an egg."

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:15.434
And finally, Netflix recently
unveiled plans to open two

00:03:15.434 --> 00:03:18.501
so-called Netflix House venues
where customers can eat, drink,

00:03:18.501 --> 00:03:20.133
and buy merchandise,
or more likely,

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:23.367
just look at the menu
for two hours and leave.

00:03:23.367 --> 00:03:24.567
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:03:24.567 --> 00:03:26.801
We're up and running.

